    "text": "Physical Therapy First case study (Healthcare, North America) — How we solved it. Automate intake before the visit: The first workflow checks insurance eligibility and pre-builds the patient's chart the moment they request an appointment, then texts them their intake forms before they even leave the house.\nConnect scheduling across all three clinics: The second workflow ties scheduling across Roland Park, Clarksville, and Hunt Valley together, so a cancellation at one location instantly offers that slot to someone on the waitlist.\nTime review requests to real outcomes: The third workflow sends a review request only to patients who reported a genuinely good outcome, timed to their last visit, all built on PromptEMR, the system the front desk already used."
